#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/index.rst:4
msgid "This site documents the public architecture and scientific contract for the Recomposable Ecosystem Library for Integrated Coupling (RELIC) |release|. It covers mathematical foundations, all 90 certified concrete scientific ``Functor`` classes (backed by 92 IPHS certificates), runtime workflows, graph orchestration, extension rules, and the core Python API across the 16 subpackages of ``relic\\`` (594 subpackage ``.py`` files, 595 Python files including ``relic\\__init__.py``, 316,129 lines of Python, seven architecture layers plus an orthogonal control plane, and 4,643 default runtime parameters loaded from 138 YAML files)."
msgstr "本站记录可重组生态系统集成耦合库（Recomposable Ecosystem Library for Integrated Coupling, RELIC） |release| 的公开架构与科学契约，涵盖数学基础、全部 90 个已认证具体科学 ``Functor`` 类（由 92 份互连端口哈密顿系统（Interconnected Port-Hamiltonian System, IPHS）证书支撑）、运行时工作流、图编排、扩展规则，以及 ``relic\\`` 全部 16 个子包的核心 Python API（共 594 个子包 ``.py`` 文件，含 ``relic\\__init__.py`` 共 595 个 Python 文件，316,129 行 Python 代码，七层架构外加一个正交控制平面，以及由 138 个 YAML 文件加载的 4,643 个默认运行时参数）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/index.rst:14
msgid "The version shown in the page title and footer is read from the package version in ``pyproject.toml``. Every section is governed by that versioned architecture contract and its live public owners."
msgstr "页面标题和页脚显示的版本读取自 ``pyproject.toml`` 中的 package version。每个章节均受该版本化 architecture contract 及其当前公开 owner 约束。"

