#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/index.rst:62
msgid "The workflow pages on this site provide small copy-and-run examples with signatures, expected output, exceptions, and current limitations."
msgstr "本站 workflow 页面提供可复制运行的小型示例，并给出 signature、预期输出、异常和当前限制。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/index.rst:64
msgid "``tutorial\\primary`` contains 30 notebooks, ordered from environment setup through real components, coupling, conservation, calibration, data I/O, surrogate models, ensembles, assimilation, and cross-domain validation."
msgstr "``tutorial\\primary`` 包含 30 个 notebook，依次覆盖环境设置、真实组件、耦合、守恒、校准、Data I/O、surrogate model、ensemble、assimilation 与跨域验证。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/index.rst:67
msgid "``tutorial\\case`` is the full Tapajos BVOC case, with forcing provenance, configuration, simulation, monitoring, checkpoints, evaluation, and figures. It is a worked research case, not a universal benchmark dataset."
msgstr "``tutorial\\case`` 是完整的 Tapajós BVOC 实例，包含 forcing provenance、配置、模拟、监控、checkpoint、评估和图件。它是完整研究案例，不是通用 benchmark dataset。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/index.rst:71
msgid "Use the same evidence pattern throughout: preflight the environment; declare inputs and configuration; run one bounded case; inspect logs and outputs; compare numerical results with an explicit oracle or reference; record provenance; and state what the run does not prove. A successful process exit by itself is not a scientific validation."
msgstr "所有教程采用同一证据模式：预检环境；声明输入与配置；运行有界实例；检查日志和输出；用显式 oracle 或参考值比较数值结果；记录 provenance；说明该运行不能证明什么。仅进程成功退出不构成科学验证。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/index.rst:78
msgid "Documentation design references"
msgstr "文档设计参考"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/index.rst:80
msgid "The guide organization follows established earth-system documentation practice: system overview, preparation, configuration, execution, outputs, troubleshooting, science options, and benchmark-style tutorials. The `WRF Users' Guide <https://www2.mmm.ucar.edu/wrf/users/wrf_users_guide/build/html/index.html>`_ and the `CMAQ User's Guide <https://github.com/USEPA/CMAQ/blob/main/DOCS/Users_Guide/README.md>`_ are organizational references only. RELIC's APIs, equations, evidence levels, and runtime claims remain governed by this repository's current owners and tests."
msgstr "本指南按成熟地球系统软件文档方式组织：系统概览、准备、配置、执行、输出、故障排查、科学选项和 benchmark 式教程。`WRF Users' Guide <https://www2.mmm.ucar.edu/wrf/users/wrf_users_guide/build/html/index.html>`_ 与 `CMAQ User's Guide <https://github.com/USEPA/CMAQ/blob/main/DOCS/Users_Guide/README.md>`_ 仅作为组织方式参考。RELIC 的 API、方程、证据等级和 runtime 声明仍由本仓库当前 owner 与测试约束。"

